{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the <strong>ultimate sports showdown</strong> with <strong>BlastBall: All-Stars!</strong>\u00a0Choose your favorite all-star from our roster of cuddly creatures and jump into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Sports_Action.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Gameplay2.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With simple, intuitive controls that <i>adapt to each sport</i>, hopping into any game is <strong>easy</strong>! Want to score <strong>highlight reel goals</strong> and feel like an All-Star? No problem. Use the <i>left stick to aim</i> and the <i>right stick to add spin</i>, and that\u2019s it. Each hit builds up your <i>blast meter</i>, letting you slow down time and unleash a <strong>blazing-fast shot</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Trickshot.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/InstantReplay.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only have a few minutes to play? Get a match going <i>in less than 30 seconds</i>. Plus, you can customize the rules, guaranteeing non-stop fun for friends and family! Are you ready to be an All-Star?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Couch_Multiplayer.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up to 4 friends</strong> can play Air Hockey, Soccer, Gagaball, and Volleyball in this BlastBall: All-Stars <strong>demo</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Tournaments.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Options.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in simplified <strong>fan-favorite sports</strong> like soccer, gaga ball, volleyball, and air hockey. Can\u2019t decide what to play first? Battle it out in a <i>multi-sport tournament</i> to prove who\u2019s the true champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Mix_things_up.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Items2.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to bend the rules? More power to you! Giant players, tiny pucks, screwballs, and lil' bumpers... we have an ever-growing list of new items to keep your opponents on their toes. Each sport has unique settings that can be changed to mix things up, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Keep_It_Moving.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/BlastShots.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With simple, intuitive controls, hopping into any sport is easy! Utilize your blast charges and add spin to your shots to become a real All-Star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Fan_Favorite_Sports.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Menu.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've got your favorites covered (or we're working on it, at least...)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Unique_All-Stars.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Characters.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Becca, Reggie, Blaire, and Kazuo are ready to play in the demo! Each character brings unique stats and styles to keep players on their toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3230830?t=1741212867","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3230830?t=1741212867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/d79add2a3b76c7eacc27d06258ebb77925a9e9c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741212867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/d79add2a3b76c7eacc27d06258ebb77925a9e9c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741212867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the <strong>ultimate sports showdown</strong> with <strong>BlastBall: All-Stars!</strong>\u00a0Choose your favorite all-star from our roster of cuddly creatures and jump into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Sports_Action.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Gameplay2.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With simple, intuitive controls that <i>adapt to each sport</i>, hopping into any game is <strong>easy</strong>! Want to score <strong>highlight reel goals</strong> and feel like an All-Star? No problem. Use the <i>left stick to aim</i> and the <i>right stick to add spin</i>, and that\u2019s it. Each hit builds up your <i>blast meter</i>, letting you slow down time and unleash a <strong>blazing-fast shot</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Trickshot.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/InstantReplay.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only have a few minutes to play? Get a match going <i>in less than 30 seconds</i>. Plus, you can customize the rules, guaranteeing non-stop fun for friends and family! Are you ready to be an All-Star?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Couch_Multiplayer.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up to 4 friends</strong> can play Air Hockey, Soccer, Gagaball, and Volleyball in this BlastBall: All-Stars <strong>demo</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Tournaments.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Options.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in simplified <strong>fan-favorite sports</strong> like soccer, gaga ball, volleyball, and air hockey. Can\u2019t decide what to play first? Battle it out in a <i>multi-sport tournament</i> to prove who\u2019s the true champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Mix_things_up.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Items2.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to bend the rules? More power to you! Giant players, tiny pucks, screwballs, and lil' bumpers... we have an ever-growing list of new items to keep your opponents on their toes. Each sport has unique settings that can be changed to mix things up, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Keep_It_Moving.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/BlastShots.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With simple, intuitive controls, hopping into any sport is easy! Utilize your blast charges and add spin to your shots to become a real All-Star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Fan_Favorite_Sports.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Menu.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've got your favorites covered (or we're working on it, at least...)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Unique_All-Stars.png?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/extras/Characters.gif?t=1741212867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Becca, Reggie, Blaire, and Kazuo are ready to play in the demo! Each character brings unique stats and styles to keep players on their toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Will Winn Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3170060","name":"BlastBall: All-Stars"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230830/header.jpg?t=1741212867","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2024 Will Winn Games, Inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257061512,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061512/movie480.mp4?t=1740602101","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061512/movie_max.mp4?t=1740602101"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257061512/65c3d9b0d1bdf991b4a5510a1e65136a27b6e843/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740602101","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061512/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740602101","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061512/movie_max_vp9.w